<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Two-Factor Authentication</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: #333333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #dddddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #222222;
        }
        .otp {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 15px 0;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: #ffffff;
            background-color: #007bff;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777777;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Two-Factor Authentication</h1>
        <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
        <p>
            To verify yourself, please enter the One-Time Password (OTP) below:
        </p>
        <div class="otp">{{otp}}</div>
        <p>This OTP is valid for <strong>{{otpExpiry}}</strong>.</p>
        <p>If you did not attempt to log in, please ignore this email or secure your account immediately.</p>
        <p>Best regards,<br>Pinntag Security Team</p>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
